h an Army contract, we actually support the Afghan Air Force the Mi-17s in theater.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2019 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"And in some contracts, we will contract with AWS, Azure or whomever for cloud services as a pass-through, but typically, the actual provisioning of the provider of the cloud is not in our contract.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2019 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2020-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"And so, there's really - there is no pass-through, there's really no hardware implementation risk.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2019 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2020-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"And you're oftentimes in government contracting if you're simply passing through hardware, sometimes you're not allowed to put fee on that, sometimes the fee rate is less.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2020 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"To minimize business impacts and to continue to deliver innovative solutions in a cost- efficient manner, we have implemented a number of cost cutting measures across the organization.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2020 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"These actions include reduced discretionary spending, an indirect hiring freeze of non-essential open positions, and mandatory time off on alternating Fridays for indirect staff.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2020 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2020-11-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"But we could see sort of a slowing down of some of the work that we do in theater, which, frankly, is a wonderful thing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2020 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2021-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Seth Seifman","x":"I’ll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2020 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Reagan","x":"…billion was at the lower end of our guidance range due to one, better than expected indirect cost savings that translated into lower revenue on cost reimbursable programs, two, the favorable decision on the NAVY Next Gen award, which occurred later in the quarter than previously estimated…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2020 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2021-02-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"When we raised our guidance, we had Navy Next Gen, it was in the Court of Federal Claims.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2021 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2021-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Reagan","x":"We are increasing our guidance for adjusted EBITDA margin, non-GAAP EPS, and operating cash flow to account for two distinct items, the settlement of the MSA legal matter, and reduced share count resulting from our share repurchase during the quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2021 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2021-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"And I think Chris addressed it well, but our SD&A business and certainly the part that we acquired is heavily dependent on international business, which is dependent upon tariffs on airline tickets and when the volume is down, the money is not there.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2021 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2021-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"Clearly, on the cost reimbursable work, if there is wage inflation, that essentially becomes a pass-through to the customer.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2021 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2021-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher Cage","x":"As shown on Slide 8, we are maintaining our guidance for fiscal year 2021, including revenue between 13.7 million and 14.1 billion, adjusted EBITDA margin between 10.5% and 10.7%; non-GAAP diluted earnings per share between $6.35 and $6.65; and operating cash flow at or above 875 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2022-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher Cage","x":"On now, to the forward outlook, as shown on Slide 8, we are maintaining our guidance for fiscal year 2022.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2022-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Gavin Parsons","x":"And then maybe just in terms of reiterating guidance, seems like you've de -risked a lot of the risk factors that were originally in place when you guided.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2022-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"Some big tech has actually announced some layoffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2022-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"It has the potential to do that because we believe the architecture and the cost savings and the increased cybersecurity and the efficiency of this new DoD ONE-Net will be so advantageous to the government customers that people will want to migrate maybe even more agencies over time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2022-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"On to the forward outlook, as shown on slide 8 we're maintaining our guidance ranges for fiscal year 2022.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2022-11-01","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"This award, known as Sentinel, is all about getting capabilities into theater and to the combatant commanders quickly.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2022-11-01","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"We, especially in our mission and operations area, find customers who want to accelerate capability and look to the contractor base to make investments to get them capability into theater faster.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2023-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"There's payroll growth on top of that, that gives you some upside, that immediately gets passed through on the cost reimbursable programs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2022 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2023-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"I wouldn't say there's any super low-hanging fruit on the cost reduction side because we do focus on that continuously.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2023-05-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"Last quarter, I talked about cyber, zero trust, confidential compute, and generative AI.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2023-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"They've implemented a number of action, there's been some reduction in force, there's been a lot of transition there to make sure that businesses, in and of itself, is a strength, not a weakness in the quarters ahead.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2023-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roger Krone","x":"I think Chris mentioned that we have done some focused reductions in force.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2023-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"We're maintaining our guidance from the Q4 call.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2023-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"And then there were a lot of cost reduction actions that were taken.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2023-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Bell","x":"Based on these candid evaluations and proactive measures to right-size the business, we are taking a non-cash pre-tax charge of $688 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2023-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Bell","x":"With this as a backdrop, the team has moved to right-size the business, discontinue sales of an unprofitable product line, and exit numerous higher-risk, lower-return geographies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2023-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"Based on our strong Q3 and year-to-date results, we're raising our 2023 guidance for all metrics.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2023-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"Obviously, we're very pleased with the third quarter performance, and that allowed us to raise our full-year guidance by the $150 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2024-02-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tom Bell","x":"Macro picture, obviously Software, Cyber, AI, Maritime Autonomy are four of the top things we're investing in.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2024-02-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"There are some activity that we're not interested in low margin work, so some of the pass through will not show up as revenue for Leidos, but overall you can expect this to be an accretive margin program to Leidos overall and with a ramping revenue profile probably more later in the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2023 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2024-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Sheila Kahyaoglu","x":"Maybe one big picture and then one on the segment restructuring, resegmentation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2024 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2024-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Bell","x":"I'm also proud of the fact that this robust first half of 2024 allows us to once again raise guidance for the full year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2024 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2024-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"So, at this point in time, with two quarters to go and two-thirds of our cash commitment for the year ahead of us, we just didn't feel it was prudent to increase the guidance at this time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2024 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tom Bell","x":"Because of our continued ahead of the curve investments in this business with AI, virtual health and other key technology enablers, and investing in overall capacity, we're positioned to continue to respond with quality and speed to the increased volumes and complexity of exams the PACT Act creates.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2024 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tom Bell","x":"With our scale and technical depth, our investments in cutting edge Trusted Mission AI, and the talent mission focus of our team, we are poised to demonstrate our ability to handle even greater volumes of exams with excellent quality, timeliness and veteran customer satisfaction.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2024 Q3","e":"ldos","d":"2024-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"And lastly, we're increasing our guidance for operating cash flow by $50 million to approximately $1.35 billion for the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2024 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2025-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"The new administration has signaled a focus on eliminating regulations, streamlining procurement and moving to more outcome-based contracting, all of which are exactly in line with the mission and work of Leidos to make government smarter and more efficient.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2024 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2025-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"Leidos is delivering significant cost savings to the SSA through these customer efficiency enhancements and proven anti-fraud tools.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2025 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2025-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Gautam Khanna","x":"And if you could also just comment broadly on what you're seeing in that business given the VA itself is trying to reduce headcount and how that might evolve, how that might impact the business, if at all, in terms of...?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2025 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2025-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Bell","x":"We're confirming our 2025 guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2025 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2025-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"So with one quarter in the books and looking ahead to the landscape that's robust with opportunities, that's why it's now not the time to lean into increasing our guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LDOS 2025 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2026-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher R. Cage","x":"I think that is a strength of Leidos, an area that Tom alluded to, our transformation office, one of the initial things they are gonna be taking on are ways that we can look to even streamline our DSO process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/leidos-ldos-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2025 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2026-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"Will's mission is to deliver measurable transformational cost reduction outcomes for us and then help transfer them into our customer solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/leidos-ldos-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2025 Q4","e":"ldos","d":"2026-02-17","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stuart Davis","x":"Enabling us to raise guidance twice this year and exceed the top end of our margin, earnings, and cash flow ranges this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/leidos-ldos-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2026-05-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"I can't comment on specific theaters or specific programs when it comes to that, except to say the Navy is very moving very quickly now with their MUSV industry program, and we are one of a few companies that we believe incredibly deliver against that need.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/leidos-ldos-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"To close out my prepared remarks this morning, I'd also like to spend a moment on AI and what it means for Leidos.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/leidos-ldos-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"As part of this, as I've just alluded to, is an often underappreciated advantage for Leidos in this booming world of AI, the sheer scale of our federal digital infrastructure business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/leidos-ldos-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"What we did at the beginning of this year was streamline how we are organized for delivery of these effects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/leidos-ldos-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"This unified health platform is a capability the team is deploying internally later this year, as an example, that will take more cost out of our delivery equation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/leidos-ldos-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"As a result of this strong core performance and the immediately accretive nature of our Entrust acquisition, we are raising our 2026 guidance for revenue by $500 million, non-GAAP diluted EPS by $0.05 and operating cash flow by $50 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/leidos-ldos-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q1","e":"ldos","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"As Tom mentioned, we're raising our 2026 guidance for revenues, earnings and cash.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/leidos-ldos-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Bell","x":"And because of the benefits of our NorthStar 2030 Strategy and the resilience of our portfolio, we can once again raise our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/04/leidos-ldos-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LDOS 2026 Q2","e":"ldos","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cage","x":"Importantly, we are diversifying the earnings power of the company, so we are able to raise guidance despite the VBA MDE changes that layer in over the third and fourth quarters this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/04/leidos-ldos-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[37,1,8244,0,0,0,6382,1431],[38,1,7417,0,0,0,5670,1327],[39,1,8505,2,2,0,6730,1391],[40,1,7700,0,0,0,6377,942],[41,1,8258,0,0,0,6736,1129],[42,1,8327,0,0,0,6701,1219],[43,1,9445,1,1,0,7418,1576],[44,1,8144,0,0,0,6346,1389],[45,1,7685,0,0,0,6093,1149],[46,1,9247,0,0,0,7717,1097],[47,1,9600,0,0,0,7914,1206],[48,1,9023,0,0,0,7384,1199],[49,1,9580,0,0,0,7661,1380],[50,1,9408,0,0,0,7487,1406],[51,1,9580,2,2,0,7902,1302],[52,1,10349,0,0,0,8405,1443],[53,1,9048,0,0,0,7474,1262]